U.S. Department of Energy, Advanced Manufacturing Office. Improving Steam System Performance: A Sourcebook for Industry, second edition, revised 2012. [Official complete 64-file-page book](https://www.energy.gov/sites/prod/files/2014/05/f15/steamsourcebook.pdf).

Read the whole system description and relevant technical improvement material: generation, distribution, end use, recovery and continued maintenance/measurement. Reconstruct a process steam and condensate account with actual pressure/temperature/enthalpy and load histories. Separate physical guidance from historical tariff, supplier and programme information.

The title, edition, institutional authorship, contents and official full-text route were checked on 29 October 2026. Preserve the document's actual notices, contributions and component rights; public government hosting does not establish a single blanket licence for every contributed image or table. The PDF and referenced external tools are not bundled.

